1794732858.343686 write(1</home/pratz/guardianai-paired-workflow-v2/final-recovery/session/evidence/step-003/stdout.txt>, "==== build_release.py 11\n22:'seccomp_gate.py', 'guarded_agent.py', 'guarded_session.py', 'session_observer.py', 'agent_observer.py', 'decision_review.py', 'guardian_mcp.py', 'build_release\n29:if abi.get('policy_version') != 3 or abi.get('launch_guard_version') != 1:\n33:'Requires Python 3.10+, Bubblewrap with user namespaces, and strace with native stack support.\\n'\n34:'Provide TYPESAFE_API_KEY only to the trusted supervisor environment.\\n'\n36:'Keep protected resources outside every public/runtime mount; snapshots are limited to 32 KiB.\\n\\n'\n40:'Workers cannot install their own seccomp filters in this profile.\\n'\n41:'Private /var/run/nscd/socket and /run/nscd/socket connects receive emulated ENOENT without executing a connection. Other connect requests stop the scope.\\n'\n42:'Requires strace --kill-on-exit and a guard-version-1 helper. The trusted tracer is tied to the supervising Linux thread by SIGKILL parent-death notification.\\n\n47:'Exit 77: detected violation. Exit 78: abstention. Otherwise the worker exit"..., 5285) = 5285
 > /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6() [0x91e92]
